OL,3,GNEWSADesigners sought to make park     
OL,4,Avision a reality                       
OL,6,FA parish has began its search for a    
OL,7,Fdesign team to re-imagine a park after 
OL,8,Fa community consultation brought in    
OL,9,Fideas from local children, schools,    
OL,10,Fyouth groups and residents.            
OL,12,FThe Parish of St Helier heard from     
OL,13,FFirst Tower residents and the wider    
OL,14,Fcommunity about what they love about St
OL,15,FAndrew's Park and what they would like 
OL,16,Fto change.                             
OL,18,FIt said the consultation highlighted   
OL,19,Fhow much the community valued the      
OL,20,Fpark's existing green space and the    
OL,21,Fdemand for more places to sit, eat and 
OL,22,Fmeet.                                  
